WEBVTT

00:06:59.290 --> 00:07:04.290
but they signal a new direction of travel.

00:07:04.990 --> 00:07:06.976
What's really exciting

00:07:07.000 --> 00:07:11.796
is that the technologies we need
for this transformation are here today,

00:07:11.820 --> 00:07:13.376
commercially available,

00:07:13.400 --> 00:07:15.806
getting cheaper and getting better.

00:07:15.830 --> 00:07:17.646
Look at batteries.

00:07:17.670 --> 00:07:22.326
Their cost went down
90 percent in 10 years,

00:07:22.350 --> 00:07:26.386
and there are new opportunities
to repurpose these batteries

00:07:26.410 --> 00:07:28.486
for energy storage

00:07:28.510 --> 00:07:31.386
or to recycle them once they wear down.